# Hub Comercial — Arquitectura Next.js

## Stack Completo

| Capa | Tecnología | Versión/Config |
|------|------------|----------------|
| Framework | Next.js | 16.2.7 (App Router, Turbopack) |
| CSS | Tailwind | v4 via `@tailwindcss/postcss` |
| Frontend JS | Alpine.js | 3.14.9 (CDN) |
| Frontend JS | HTMX | 2.0.4 (CDN) |
| Charts | Chart.js | 4.4.4 + annotation plugin 3.0.1 |
| Font | Inter | rsms.me CDN |
| Backend | Next.js API Routes | TypeScript |
| DB Client | @google-cloud/bigquery | 7.x |
| Cache | In-memory Map | 2hr TTL, 500 entries |
| Deploy | Vercel | Auto on main push |

