## Estructura de Archivos Clave

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx                    # Global: navbar, fonts, HTMX, Chart.js, Tailwind config
│   ├── page.tsx                      # Home cards
│   ├── globals.css                   # Tailwind v4 imports + dark mode variant
│   ├── components/
│   │   └── Navbar.tsx                # Global nav tabs (Alpine via dangerouslySetInnerHTML)
│   ├── api/                          # 5 API routes (action dispatch)
│   │   ├── funnel/mm/route.ts
│   │   ├── funnel/inmo/route.ts
│   │   ├── funnel/combinado/route.ts
│   │   ├── conversion/seller/route.ts
│   │   └── funnel/mm/precios-subsidios/route.ts
│   └── funnel/mm|inmo|combinado/conversion/seller/page.tsx
├── lib/
│   ├── bq.ts                         # BigQuery singleton + cache
│   ├── accounts.ts                   # Email exclusion lists
│   └── data.ts                       # CSV/JSON loaders
├── templates/                        # 5 HTML templates (converted from Jinja2)
│   ├── funnel-mm.html
│   ├── funnel-inmo.html
│   ├── funnel-combinado.html
│   ├── conversion-seller.html
│   └── funnel-mm-kpis.html (legacy)
└── data/                             # Static CSVs/JSON
```

