## Flujo de Datos

```
Usuario → Dashboard (Alpine + HTMX)
  → Filtros → buildQS() → /api/funnel/mm?action=volumen&...
  → Next.js API Route (route.ts)
    → bq.query(sql) → BigQuery (Cross-project)
    → Cache hit/miss (2hr TTL)
    → JSON response
  → Alpine renders: Chart.js, KPIs, Tables
```

